  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building resilience through gender and conflict sensitive approaches South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has overall objective of building the resilience of targeted people in Juba through gender and conflict sensitive approaches to education, skills development and sustainable livelihoods in South Sudan. conflict affected adolescents, youth, women and men will be enabled to improve their knowledge and skill through safe, quality and gender responsive/sensitive education and skills development. Additionally, local leadership will be strengthened to ensure resilient education systems and sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
